---
---
<section class="py-32 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-am-dark via-am-blue/20 to-am-dark pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[800px] h-[800px] bg-am-accent/20 rounded-full blur-[200px] pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03] bg-grid pointer-events-none"></div>

  <!-- Decorative boxes -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none">
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-[10%] w-64 h-64 border border-am-accent/10 rounded-lg rotate-12"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-1/4 right-[10%] w-48 h-48 border border-am-yellow/10 rounded-lg -rotate-12"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center reveal">

      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
        Detrás de cada proyecto hay una forma de pensar el diseño
      </h2>

      <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 mb-12 leading-relaxed">
        Estos casos son una muestra de cómo en Areamovil usamos UX/UI para resolver retos reales,
        conectar necesidades y construir experiencias digitales con intención.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/team" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-am-yellow text-am-dark font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded-lg
                 text-lg shadow-lg shadow-am-yellow/20 hover:bg-am-yellow/90 transition-all duration-300">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          Conoce al team
        </a>
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-transparent border-2 border-am-accent
                 text-am-accent rounded-lg hover:bg-am-accent/10 transition-all duration-300 group text-lg font-semibold">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 group-hover:-translate-x-1 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
          Volver al Home
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
